{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t國家主席習近平在深圳出席亞太經合組織工商領導人峰會開幕式，並發表主旨演講。<br/>\n<br/>\n他表示，中方願同各方攜手建設亞太共同體，促進亞太共同繁榮，亦支持成立世界灣區經濟合作聯盟，探索亞太經濟合作新路徑。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：王濱南\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T12:24:19.067218+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T12:01:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T18:38:06.507908+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T12:17:26.127874+00:00","content_hash":"32ed3c9f9d02a669555e36709d0e9370786cfdbfee37f39ef1102eb9e1d0881b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}